      "text": "Un’wana na un’wana u ni fanelo yo kuma tifanelo na mitshunxeko leswi boxiweke eka Xiboho lexi, ehandle ka xihlawuhlawu xa muxaka wihi na wihi, ku va ku ri hi rixaka, muhlovo, rimbewu, ririmi, ripfumelo, swa tipolitiki kumbe mavonelo man’ wana, swa tiko kumbe ntumbuluko wa mahanyelo, tinhundzu, ku tswariwa kumbe swiyimo swin’wana."
     }
